{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t韓聯社報道，韓國仁川市一間大型超市發生持刀傷人事件，增至8人受傷，其中1人心臟驟停，涉嫌行兇男子被捕。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n報道說，事發在當地時間下午2時前，消防部門接報，仁川市南洞區一間超市發生持刀傷人事件。當局正在調查事件具體經過。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T08:02:05.804608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T07:12:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T08:27:56.380854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:24.341228+00:00","content_hash":"d54f8ce5c410f431f90dbb77d156ff89c271897acbe1c1acddfbe9253bc5ccb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}